\define pub() [!is[system]!tag[hide]!tag[private]!prefix[.]]

Maintenance lists for the live wiki. Tagged `hide`, so the static build leaves it out. Each list updates as you edit.

!! Missing (<$count filter="[all[missing]!is[system]]"/>)

Titles that something links to and that have no note yet.

<$list filter="[all[missing]!is[system]sort[title]]"><$link/> <$text text="·"/> </$list>

!! Empty (<$count filter="[subfilter<pub>!has[text]]"/>)

A title and no body.

<$list filter="[subfilter<pub>!has[text]sort[title]]"><$link/> <$text text="·"/> </$list>

!! Stubs (<$count filter="[subfilter<pub>has[text]] :filter[get[text]length[]compare:number:lt[200]]"/>)

Notes with fewer than 200 characters, shortest first. Change the 200 in the two filters here to move the line.

<$list filter="[subfilter<pub>has[text]] :filter[get[text]length[]compare:number:lt[200]] :sort:number[get[text]length[]]"><$link/> <$text text="·"/> </$list>

!! Orphans (<$count filter="[all[orphans]] :intersection[subfilter<pub>]"/>)

Notes that nothing links to. This counts links only, so a note that is reachable through a tag still shows here.

<$list filter="[all[orphans]] :intersection[subfilter<pub>] +[sort[title]]"><$link/> <$text text="·"/> </$list>
